# The own pass's findings in std's own functions that tests/std/own.sh
# accepts: `CODE ITEM  why`. Each is a pattern of std's internals the pass
# does not model yet, not a view that outlives what it views; remove a line
# once the pass or std changes (own.sh notes a line no longer found).
own.conflict std::Buf::push_fmt  a Fmt writes the room of the Buf it views (fmt's design, 0.16)
own.conflict std::string::String::push_fmt  the same, into the String's bytes
own.conflict std::collections::raw_table::RawTable::probe_stats  reads its elements through raw pointers while iterating (tests only)
own.escape std::Vec::sort_by_key  the comparing closure's view of g taken for one stored into the elements (the summary of sort_stable_less_in)
own.escape std::slice::sort_stable_by_in  the same
own.escape std::collections::hash_map::HashMap::raw_table  a `-> let T` result (#[views(self)]): projections are not in the own pass yet
own.escape std::collections::raw_table::RawTable::get  the same
own.readonly std::fmt::fmt_byte  writes the room fmt_make_room returns as `[u8]` (to be `inout [u8]`)
own.conflict std::gpu::wgsl::msl::W::struct_def  b.push_fmt's nm(self.pool, ..) between self.member_ty calls: the Buf b is a local, the pool is read by value (0.22.1: projections)
own.conflict std::gpu::wgsl::msl::write_entry  w.intern copies into w.pool; in_buf is a separate local Buf (0.22.1: projections)
own.escape std::gpu::wgsl::msl::W::image_load  push_fmt into a Buf<ScopedArena> copies the bytes; the checker takes the arena-viewing Buf as keeping a view of lb (0.22.1)
own.escape std::gpu::wgsl::msl::W::lit  self.p(s) copies s's bytes into self.out; the arena-viewing Buf is taken as keeping a view of b (0.22.1)
own.escape std::gpu::wgsl::msl::write_entry  push_fmt/push_str into w.out copy the bytes; the arena-viewing Buf is taken as keeping a view of in_buf, nb (0.22.1)
own.escape std::gpu::wgsl::msl::zero_workgroup  push_fmt of lv into w.out copies the bytes; the arena-viewing Buf is taken as keeping a view of b (0.22.1)
